(
    doc = """Stub physics-material layer for ConveyorBelt_A06.usd.

    The conveyor sublayers this file, but it was missing from the repository,
    which produced "Could not load sublayer ... physics_material.usd" warnings.
    The shirt-place task disables the conveyor's own colliders and rests the
    cloth on a dedicated box collider, so no concrete physics material is needed
    here; this valid (empty) layer resolves the sublayer and silences the warning.
    """
)
